[{"title":"谢伯子为长公奕修纳妇即赴郧阳任诗以送之","author":"黎遂球","text":"凤楼宵映谢毛丰，凫舄朝飞叶县风。\n为邑却应如好妇，高堂难得似痴翁。\n郧阳易建汾阳业，棠树何殊宝树丛。\n此去只须勤报国，膝边人与子仪同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34477,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何象冈太史还朝","author":"黎遂球","text":"彤云翘首是承明，迢递长安事远征。\n客里数梅疏放腊，禁中千柳待舒晴。\n商宗梦帝欣逢说，汉室安刘定相平。\n入座正呼何次道，登瀛新挟董双成。\n鸡林鬻去香山句，凤藻赓来柏殿声。\n万姓只今看捧日，中朝端此赖调羹。\n已知开阁平津盛，徒愧通家北海名。\n遂以过庭劳缓颊，翻从祖帐恋交情。\n银鱼捧别馀烟墅，铜狄摩空想玉京。\n一曲骊歌天万里，蓬莱高隔五仙城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34478,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至南都呈大宗伯李小湾先生","author":"黎遂球","text":"四朝耆望重纶丝，天上元杓帝者师。\n南国化行周礼乐，西京咸肃汉威仪。\n河图顾自先皇命，鱼藻赓深圣主知。\n岂止文章雄八代，更隆声望拜诸彝。\n三台辅弼方虚左，五百夔龙正及期。\n分陕召公书并著，赉形商佐梦恭思。\n龙门尽仰知名士，鲤对曾看历齿儿。\n感激延陵犹挂剑，将无有道愧题碑。\n问牛调燮逢兹日，舐犊恩情念昔时。\n赋比枚皋徒率尔，序惭王勃怅何之。\n雕虫几度愁铅椠，附骥差应致汉逵。\n北海通家宁敢拟，南山聊赋有台诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34479,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禺峡山中人朱叔子玉笑堂成人来索诗书云玉笑之义不求甚解然予作诗正不必此诗真足相当也率尔报之二十韵","author":"黎遂球","text":"白石行歌自可思，惟君玉笑我能知。\n天高有客投壶过，月冷何人捉麈宜。\n骑鹤吹笙调子晋，投瓜曳舄戏安期。\n梅心喜跃初输梦，山色玲珑互放眉。\n环系峡猿聊破涕，霜侵木客跳吟诗。\n将因凤叫弹瑶瑟，绝胜尘来擘荔枝。\n佩有香兰弦语细，炉供兔药杵声迟。\n露桃匀碧低憨脸，墨蕊含毫尽解颐。\n洞里素书传舞剑，阶前屐齿折观棋。\n宁如罢席唉双斗，可有占璜挂一丝。\n蛟断过河心亦壮，龙狞溅血胆虽奇。\n耕蓝尽是伤三刖，被褐何妨慰五噫。\n万卷筑城酬什袭，三珠为树亚参差。\n溪云学水敲冰听，泉眼流波入茗嬉。\n瑑却娲天娱老态，雕成郢雪快吟姿。\n晕笼银烛销烟泪，叠戛琅玕未粉疲。\n好下晶帘媒蛱蝶，岂如昙钵吠琉璃。\n象王定与拈花会，下士何劳刻叶疑。\n莫逆相看攻石意，往来珍重过溪时。\n缄书偶亦堪璚报，或称磨圭三复诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34480,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡江有述","author":"黎遂球","text":"花柳东南映别筵，江涛飘撼渡头船。\n霄高往见云摩水，地坼功怜木济川。\n飞鸟欲归停岛树，神鱼将起喷波烟。\n二仪象阔分吴野，八卦风雄近楚天。\n潮汐互吞时候转，阴晴中漏雨阳穿。\n千层激浪俄喧号，一泻湍洄忽沸漩。\n山立作门排闼过，寺浮如舰与钟悬。\n回看乍觉人声断，逆渡犹吹帆影前。\n土俗顿殊城两岸，辰炊隔望渺重渊。\n中原此去愁多事，枥马频嘶又著鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34481,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲","author":"黎遂球","text":"尘动起秋风，灯黄夜帐中。\n不寐磨长剑，明朝第一功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34482,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌夜啼二首 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"门前一树乌，双双背背啼。\n双栖尚自啼，不顾儿郎妻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34483,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌夜啼二首 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"侬歌乌夜啼，郎行白马蹄。\n白颈不如乌，白头当自归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34484,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜歌","author":"黎遂球","text":"狂风灭烛光，房栊映飞雪。\n解衣莫畏寒，见侬情自热。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34485,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲","author":"黎遂球","text":"湖头采莲女，不向藕花前。\n笑脸晕芙蓉，相看名采莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34486,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古别离曲","author":"黎遂球","text":"泪珠若可穿，串成千万尺。\n系足送郎行，缚郎回与妾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34487,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"懊恼歌三首 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"欢初恋侬时，夜夜门前立。\n今日欢弃侬，对人不敢泣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34488,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"懊恼歌三首 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"开门认欢船，行前笑相语。\n春风打布帆，回头下滩去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34489,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"懊恼歌三首 其三","author":"黎遂球","text":"打散双鸳鸯，莫与欢侬似。\n不似欢去时，欢来便如此。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34490,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"黎遂球","text":"用发织郎衣，纵横系胸腹。\n缚不得人心，千丝那能足。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34491,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈顺虎东皋二首 其一 浣清堂","author":"黎遂球","text":"秋光濯须眉，春翠浮杯酒。\n况复挥麈谈，玉柄如人手。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34492,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈顺虎东皋二首 其二 玉带桥","author":"黎遂球","text":"曾眠宝带桥，醉弄太湖月。\n今日坐长虹，清寒彻毛发。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34493,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何龙甫姨兄村庄作","author":"黎遂球","text":"十亩平田上，烟横浅绿寒。\n落花随雨换，雏蝶试风难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34494,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹圃游宴诗六首 其一","author":"黎遂球","text":"选得金钗客，屏风引碧阑。\n翱翔三十六，曲曲映双弯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34495,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹圃游宴诗六首 其二","author":"黎遂球","text":"腾鞭金埒抹，注矢绿埃涓。\n亭上歌声远，飞还鸣角弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34496,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹圃游宴诗六首 其三","author":"黎遂球","text":"香厨临竹港，易损牡丹芽。\n却渡兰桡过，檀槽滴落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34497,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹圃游宴诗六首 其四","author":"黎遂球","text":"春气生阶草，轻寒破腊梅。\n捲帘娱瑞雪，公子正多才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34498,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹圃游宴诗六首 其五","author":"黎遂球","text":"歌伎悬灯引，材官导马归。\n更移花下席，取次换寒衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34499,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹圃游宴诗六首 其六","author":"黎遂球","text":"棋枰围屐齿，酒态弄貂裘。\n记取荆州客，人人万户侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34500,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顷读书虎丘仰苏楼一夜为龙雨所拔因与某上人创而新之文湛持相公为题曰来贤堂兹隔岁重来上人复增建诸精舍偶援笔各题二十字五首 其一 来贤堂","author":"黎遂球","text":"客去山花落，客来山鸟飞。\n帘内香如线，山僧云补衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34501,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顷读书虎丘仰苏楼一夜为龙雨所拔因与某上人创而新之文湛持相公为题曰来贤堂兹隔岁重来上人复增建诸精舍偶援笔各题二十字五首 其二 雪艇","author":"黎遂球","text":"野艇居非水，离钩钓新月。\n圆时作雪看，雪际云波汩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34502,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顷读书虎丘仰苏楼一夜为龙雨所拔因与某上人创而新之文湛持相公为题曰来贤堂兹隔岁重来上人复增建诸精舍偶援笔各题二十字五首 其三 玲珑栈","author":"黎遂球","text":"石级上山堂，梧桐荫曲廊。\n朱阑围碧牖，曲曲塔灯光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34503,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顷读书虎丘仰苏楼一夜为龙雨所拔因与某上人创而新之文湛持相公为题曰来贤堂兹隔岁重来上人复增建诸精舍偶援笔各题二十字五首 其四 小吴轩","author":"黎遂球","text":"白马看如练，苏台故是台。\n西施当日醉，飞向掌中来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34504,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顷读书虎丘仰苏楼一夜为龙雨所拔因与某上人创而新之文湛持相公为题曰来贤堂兹隔岁重来上人复增建诸精舍偶援笔各题二十字五首 其五 放眉","author":"黎遂球","text":"绮罗香十里，歌管占千人。\n别有松窗寂，山眉放小春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34505,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳歌行寄两弟","author":"黎遂球","text":"可怜同巢燕，孤飞向春殿。\n不若衔花归，寻巢得相见。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34506,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古剑行","author":"黎遂球","text":"我有殊方剑，寻常把赠人。\n丈夫空手立，犹自足谋身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34507,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南曲","author":"黎遂球","text":"江南二三月，花柳映山青。\n送君江北去，草绿到长亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34508,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮马长城窟","author":"黎遂球","text":"饮马长城窟，城下多腥血。\n战渴口沫乾，人衔一片雪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34509,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上阳白发人","author":"黎遂球","text":"本自缘殊色，蒙恩入上阳。\n君王不相见，绿发已侵霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":34510,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫溪翁歌","author":"黎遂球","text":"坐上紫溪翁，囊悬古铜镜。\n醉后向人谈，松枝作麈柄。","col